UNIT_ID: U-009
NAME: Attention-Based Timing of Automated Service
LENS: LENS_SYSTEM
TYPE: process_constraint
STATUS: SOURCE_SUPPORTED
FUNCTION: Timing automated services zależy od estimated readiness użytkownika; model attention (np. dwell time vs message length) deferuje akcję do momentu, gdy cost of interruption jest niższy.
MINIMAL_FORM:
  - monitor user activity (message size, focus, signs of thinking: "hmmm…")
  - fit timing model (sigmoid: dwell time = f(message length))
  - defer service until predicted ready time; increase dwell if user shows signs of thinking
  - allow fixed delay or custom-tailored model via learning mode
