UNIT_ID: U-011
NAME: Autonomy as Design Decision Independent of Capability
LENS: LENS_SYSTEM
TYPE: design_principle
STATUS: SOURCE_SUPPORTED
FUNCTION: Rozróżnienie agency (capacity to act intentionally) i autonomy (extent to which agent is designed to operate without user involvement); ta sama capability może być użyta na różnych poziomach autonomii przez różne constraints (invocation, approval, consultation).
MINIMAL_FORM:
  - agency: set of tools/actions available to agent
