UNIT_ID: U-012
NAME: Metacognitive Demands of GenAI — Goal Setting, Output Evaluation, Workflow Optimization
LENS: LENS_KNOWLEDGE
TYPE: claim
STATUS: CONDITIONAL
FUNCTION: GenAI systems impose high metacognitive demands on users: muszą monitorować i kontrolować własne myślenie (goal setting, evaluating outputs, optimizing workflows) przy jednoczesnej ekspozycji na fluent, persuasive outputs; metacognition jako lens do zrozumienia usability challenges.
MINIMAL_FORM:
  - users must set goals explicitly (prompting)
  - users must evaluate AI outputs critically (detect hallucinations, bias, relevance)
  - users must optimize workflows (decide when to delegate, iterate, or stop)
  - metacognitive support strategies could reduce demands (explainability, customizability)
